{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39979","headline":"送卢拾遗归华山 · 徐夤","name":"送卢拾遗归华山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫殿谏多防佞口，清秋假满别明君。\n惟忧急诏归青琐，不得经时卧白云。\n千载茯苓携鹤斸，一峰仙掌与僧分。\n门前旧客期相荐，犹望飞书及主文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39979.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39979","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}